    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on darwin1859-ch03-07: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.58";
    dc:description "Naturalization and climate data permit the abiotic component to be modeled globally, but direct biotic covariates are limited to experiments and local studies. The 'mainly' causal comparison is therefore restricted.";
