    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: For introduced garden plants that survive cultivation, model naturalization success from abiotic climatic suitability and measured competition or herbivory. Strong biotic effects after high abiotic suitability supports mainly indirect limitation.";
