    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.1.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Competition and herbivory are not globally measured.", "Non-naturalization may reflect propagule pressure.";
